          "urpx:description": "Customer must be a residential customer whose service address is a housing unit with a recorded deed restriction limiting occupancy to income-qualified tenants (typically LIHTC-funded, state Multifamily Housing Program-funded, or local inclusionary-housing-ordinance units). Eligibility is unit-level rather than customer-level — based on the property's deed-restriction status as documented in property records, regardless of the individual customer's current income.",
